HOW TO RE-RUN THIS CAPTURE

  PROOF_STUB_PORT=4599 node docs/proof/console-frontend-audit-2026-09-01/proof-stub.mjs &

  cd apps/web-console
  NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4599 \
  NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=proof-anon-key \
  NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3199 \
  CONTROL_PLANE_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4599 \
  npx next build && npx next start -p 3199 &

  PROOF_APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3199 PROOF_STUB_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4599 \
  PROOF_ANON_KEY=proof-anon-key PROOF_OUT_DIR=/tmp/console-audit-shots \
  PROOF_APP_DIR="$PWD/apps/web-console" \
  node docs/proof/console-frontend-audit-2026-09-01/proof-shots.mjs

Every line under CAPTURES is an assertion, not a recording: the harness exits
non-zero and writes no screenshot when one of them is false. Verified by
pointing PROOF_APP_URL at the stub instead of the console, which failed with
"claim failed: GET /console/catalog/does-not-exist-model status was 404,
expected 200".
